SUMMARY:Guild Artist Exhibition & Sale
DESCRIPTION:Summer brings fresh inspiration\, and our Guild Artists have been busy creating new work to share. Join us for the Guild Artist Exhibition & Sale\, featuring an exciting collection of original paintings and fine art.  \n\nDiscover new landscapes\, still lifes\, contemporary works\, and more as you explore the Guild Galleries. Whether you’re an avid collector\, art enthusiast\, or simply looking for inspiration\, this exhibition offers a wonderful opportunity to experience the creativity that continues to thrive in Brown County. 
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/guild-artist-exhibition-sale-8/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/artist_exhib_web_event-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
